<title>USA: Immucor Q3 shr, profit drops.</title>
<headline>Immucor Q3 shr, profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended Feb. 28, 1997    Nine months ended Feb. 29 1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.17		    $0.27</p>
<p> Net		 1,424,113		2,334,116</p>
<p> Net sales	 25,953,819	     22,831,459</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   8,588,320		8,801,288</p>
<p>   Three months ended Feb. 29, 1997     Three months ended Feb. 29, 1996</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.04		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net		 344,225		  788,156</p>
<p> Revs		9,639,697		8,073,228</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  8,518,645		8,884,564</p>
<p>Note: Net income for three months ended Feb. 28, 1997 included a quarter charge of about $105,000 net of taxes. The company said the charge was for transaction losses on European business.</p>
</text>
